"BV-BRC by NCBI Taxonomy ID. Returns taxon name, rank, lineage, "
"alternative names, and genome counts. Useful for resolving pathogen "
"taxonomy and understanding classification hierarchy. Example: '2697049' "
"returns SARS-CoV-2 taxonomy with full lineage from Viruses to species."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/bvbrc_tools.rst:98 649e89a0cc4b413f8fc2dbf0bfafbbe6
