msgid ""
"**Description**: Search for antimicrobial resistance (AMR) phenotype data"
" in BV-BRC. Returns resistance/susceptibility data for pathogens against "
"specific antibiotics, including MIC values, testing methods, and "
"evidence. Essential for AMR surveillance research. Example: search for "
"methicillin resistance in Staphylococcus aureus."
