#: ../../tools/bvbrc_tools.rst:171 a22d13c4edff40b2942234cc910b7e43
msgid ""
"``protein_name`` (string, null) (optional) Target protein name to filter "
"epitopes. Examples: 'Spike glycoprotein', 'Nucleocapsid protein', "
"'Replicase polyprotein 1ab'."
