#: ../../tools/bvbrc_tools.rst:174 b1d9229a99024649ba44b1f6a298a5f6
msgid ""
"``epitope_type`` (string, null) (optional) Type of epitope. Options: "
"'Linear peptide', 'Discontinuous peptide'. Most epitopes are linear "
"peptides."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/bvbrc_tools.rst:177 f9e33ac19db641509df46335109bc131
msgid ""
"``organism`` (string, null) (optional) Organism name keyword to search "
"across epitope records. Example: 'coronavirus', 'influenza'."
